'''Generow''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{zone|Jerry's Workshop}} only in the month of December. They can be talked to to see [[Gifts|Gifting]] Milestones.

== Gifting Milestones ==
'''Generow''' grants the [[Player]] rewards based on how many gifts they've given to unique Players. When holding a [[Gifts|Gift]], players will see a green {{Rmt|&a✉}} above players they have not gifted to before and a red {{Rmt|&c✉}} above those they have already gifted to.

== Rewards ==
{{/UI}}
The cumulative rewards at {{Rmt|&aLevel XXV (25)}} are:

* {{Item|North Stars|amount=40}}
* {{Item|Ice Essence|amount=80}}
* {{Item|Frozen Bait|amount=360}}
* {{Item|Gift of Learning|amount=8}}
* {{Item|Einary's Red Hoodie}}
* {{Item|Expensive Toy}}
* Gift of Giving [[SkyBlock Levels#Emblems|Emblem]] {{Rmt|&6✉}}

